  Outcome: explicit supported state inventory and migration boundaries that later work can implement.
  Decisions and source evidence: Rendering.AuthoritativePipelineState.md / Graphics submission design contract.
  Traceability: consumer inventory -> Consumer and mutation coverage; supported defaults -> Supported state and defaults;
  layouts/targets/lifetime -> Geometry, target and executable contracts; restoration -> Restoration decisions by boundary;
  reference cases and evidence categories -> Deterministic reference and evidence boundaries.
  Scope reconciliation: user-directed context recovery removal supersedes original generation requirements.
  Completed 2026-10-05: second source review and independent audit-stage-completion passed with no findings.
  Validation: source/contract inventory, linked-file validation and git diff --check. Documentation-only;
  no new build, headless-rendering, live-game or performance result is claimed.

